{"id":"23862bee6d995eec","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-replacement-product-expansion.md","title":"平衡替换积的谱隙界","display":"thm-replacement-product-expansion — 平衡替换积的谱隙界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-replacement-product-expansion","aliases":["28-thm-replacement-product-expansion"],"display":"thm-replacement-product-expansion — 平衡替换积的谱隙界","depends_on":["[[28-df-replacement-product]]","[[28-df-spectral-expander]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 21.18","source_printed_pages":"437–438","source_pdf_pages":"463–464","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-replacement-product-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-replacement-product-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-replacement-product-expansion — 平衡替换积的谱隙界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f8284ae43439ae52\" href=\"?note=f8284ae43439ae52\" title=\"28-df-replacement-product\">28-df-replacement-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 21.18"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"437–438"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"463–464"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=(D,d,S)\">\\(H=(D,d,S)\\)</span> 与平衡替换积采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f8284ae43439ae52\" href=\"?note=f8284ae43439ae52\" title=\"28-df-replacement-product\">28-df-replacement-product</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"df14955ee1f08cd3\" href=\"?note=df14955ee1f08cd3\" title=\"28-df-spectral-expander\">28-df-spectral-expander</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0&lt;\\epsilon,\\delta\\le1\">\\(0&lt;\\epsilon,\\delta\\le1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\\le1-\\epsilon\">\\(\\lambda(G)\\le1-\\epsilon\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(H)\\le1-\\delta\">\\(\\lambda(H)\\le1-\\delta\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H)\\le1-\\frac{\\epsilon\\delta^2}{24}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(G\\mathbin{\\circledR}H)\\le1-\\frac{\\epsilon\\delta^2}{24}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>核对原书系数 24、两图大小匹配 H 有 D 个顶点、以及平衡而非普通替换积条件。原书用三次方转移矩阵抽出云内混合—跨云—云内混合项；本次核对陈述和证明结构，未独立完成全部算子范数估计，因此保留禁止作为已核验证明依赖标记。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 21.18；印刷页 437–438；PDF 页 463–464。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-replacement-product","status":"resolved","id":"f8284ae43439ae52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","locat